OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor's office vandalised by 
OL,4,Aoil protesters                         
OL,6,FThe constituency office of South       
OL,7,FYorkshire Labour MP and Chancellor John
OL,8,FHealey has been vandalised by          
OL,9,Fprotesters campaigning against oil     
OL,10,Fdrilling in the North Sea.             
OL,12,FGreenpeace Sheffield plastered the     
OL,13,FRawmarsh and Conisbrough MP's          
OL,14,Fconstituency office in Wath upon Dearne
OL,15,Fwith Stop Rosebank posters, calling on 
OL,16,Fhim to reject giving the go-ahead to   
OL,17,Fdrilling in the oil field off the      
OL,18,Fnorth-west coast of Shetland.          
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
