OL,3,GNEWSAChancellor's office vandalised by 
OL,4,Aoil protesters                         
OL,6,FThe posters, which read "Sensible bloke
OL,7,For Shell sell-out?", were put up by two
OL,8,Factivists from the environmental       
OL,9,Fcampaign group.                        
OL,11,FA Labour spokesperson said a decision  
OL,12,Fover the oil field was "subject to a   
OL,13,Fquasi-judicial process of which        
OL,14,FGreenpeace are aware".                 
